 (스카우트) · 객관식 16번","searchText":" 16\n\n전류가 흐르는 도체의 단면적이 m, 전류가 5A,\n전계가 × Vm일 때, 도체의 전기 전도도Sm는\n\n어떻게 되는가?\n\n\n① ×         ② × \n③ ×         ④ × \n⑤ × ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m16","number":16},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m16-q.webp","width":696,"height":648},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m16-e1.webp","width":696,"height":836}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 17번","searchText":" 17\n\n자화의 세기가 398m, 자화율이 m인\n자성체의 자속밀도는 몇 m인가?\n\n\n① 200         ② 300\n\n③ 400         ④ 500\n\n⑤ 600","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m17-q.webp","width":696,"height":640},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m17-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1046}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n다음 조건에 대한 자계 에너지 밀도Jm는?\n\n       ⦁자속밀도 200m\n\n       ⦁자계 0.5Am\n\n       ⦁투자율 Hm\n\n\n\n① 50          ② 75\n\n③ 100         ④ 150\n\n⑤ 200","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m18-q.webp","width":696,"height":594},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m18-e1.webp","width":678,"height":727}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S1-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 19번","searchText":" 19\n\n서로 이웃하는 자성 이온이 반대 방향으로 정렬되지만, 서\n\n로간의 자성의 크기가 달라서 물질 전체적으로는 자발적인\n\n자성이 남아있는 물체는 무엇은가?\n\n\n① 강자성체       ② 반자성체\n\n③ 준강자성체      ④ 상자성체\n\n⑤ 초전도체","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m19-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m19-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1155}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S1-Q20","number":20,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 20번","searchText":" 20\n\n정현파 교번자속의 주파수가 4배가 되는 경우에, 코일의\n\n유기 기전력은 어떻게 되는가?\n\n\n① 4배 증가       ② 4배 감소\n\n③ 16배 증가      ④ 16배 감소\n\n⑤ 변화없음","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m20","number":20},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m20-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m20-e1.webp","width":696,"height":588}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S1-Q21","number":21,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 21번","searchText":" 21\n\n다음 정류곡선에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n\n\n\n① ⓒ는 정류초기에 불꽃이 발생한다.\n\n② ⓑ는 정현파 정류로, 정류시에 불꽃이 발생한다.\n\n③ ⓐ는 브러시 전단에 불꽃이 발생한다.\n\n④ ⓓ는 브러시 후단에 불꽃이 발생한다.\n\n⑤ ⓑ에서 ⓐ로 가면 이상적인 정류가 된다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m21","number":21},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m21-q.webp","width":678,"height":797},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m21-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1294}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S1-Q22","number":22,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 22번","searchText":" 22\n\n직류 발전기에 대한 다음 설명 중 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 직권 발전기의 무부하 운전시 계자전류가 무한대가 된다.\n\n② 직권 발전기는 계자저항은 가능한 한 작게 설계해야 한다.\n\n③ 복권 발전기는 계자가 전기자에 병렬 및 직렬로 연결되어\n\n  있다.\n\n④ 분권 발전기는 계자가 전기자에 병렬로 연결되어 있다.\n\n⑤ 분권 발전기의 무부하 운전시에 전기자 전류는 모두 계자\n\n  전류가 된다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m22","number":22},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m22-q.webp","width":696,"height":583},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m22-e1.webp","width":678,"height":403}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S1-Q23","number":23,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 23번","searchText":" 23\n\n최대허용온도가 낮은 순서대로 절연물의 종별이 나열된 것\n\n은?\n\n\n① C – H – F – E – B – A – Y\n\n② Y – A – E – B – F – H – C\n\n③ C – H – F – B – E – A – Y\n\n④ Y – A – E – F – B – H – C\n\n⑤ C – H – F – B – A – E - Y","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m23","number":23},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m23-q.webp","width":696,"height":543},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m23-e1.webp","width":678,"height":507}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S1-Q24","number":24,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 24번","searchText":" 24\n\n동기 발전기의 전력-상차각 곡선에서 최대출력W은?\n\n\n\n\n\n               \n①            ②        \n\n              \n③            ④                             \n\n  \n⑤    ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m24","number":24},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m24-q.webp","width":696,"height":757},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m24-e1.webp","width":678,"height":973}],"responseT